{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "shopdemo-collection-2026",
    "name": "ShopDemo — APIs (Catalog, Orders, Inventory, Analytics, MCP)",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints de ShopDemo para local, Azure (ACA/AKS) y AWS (ECS/EKS).\n\n## Variables de colección\n\n| Variable | Local (default) | Release |\n|---|---|---|\n| catalogBaseUrl | http://localhost:8001 | FQDN Container App / ALB / Ingress `/catalog` |\n| ordersBaseUrl | http://localhost:8002 | FQDN / Ingress `/orders` |\n| inventoryBaseUrl | http://localhost:8003 | URL interna o Ingress `/inventory` |\n| analyticsBaseUrl | http://localhost:8004 | FQDN / Ingress `/analytics` |\n| mcpBaseUrl | http://localhost:8005 | FQDN / Ingress `/mcp` (sin sufijo /mcp) |\n| deploymentProfile | local | local \\| azure-aca \\| azure-aks \\| aws-ecs \\| aws-eks |\n\n## Cómo cambiar de entorno\n\n1. Abre la colección → pestaña **Variables**.\n2. Actualiza las cinco `*BaseUrl` según tu despliegue (ver README.md y GUIA-ENDPOINTS.md).\n3. Cambia `deploymentProfile` para documentar qué perfil usas.\n\n## Flujo recomendado\n\n1. Carpeta **Health checks** — verificar que los servicios responden.\n2. Carpeta **Flujo integrado (E2E)** — compra completa.\n3. Con Event Hubs: paso 2 del E2E es opcional; usa paso 2b (Analytics).\n4. **MCP Gateway**: solo `GET /health` en Postman; las tools MCP requieren un cliente MCP (Cursor, Claude Code).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "deploymentProfile", "value": "local" },
    { "key": "catalogBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8001" },
    { "key": "ordersBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8002" },
    { "key": "inventoryBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8003" },
    { "key": "analyticsBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8004" },
    { "key": "mcpBaseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8005" },
    { "key": "customerId", "value": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health checks",
      "description": "Verificación de operación antes del E2E o tras desplegar en nube/K8s. Respuesta esperada: 200 OK.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Catalog — Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{catalogBaseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{catalogBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Catalog — Alive",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{catalogBaseUrl}}/alive", "host": ["{{catalogBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["alive"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Orders — Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{ordersBaseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{ordersBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Orders — Alive",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{ordersBaseUrl}}/alive", "host": ["{{ordersBaseUrl}}"], "path": ["alive"] }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
